{"_v":1,"id":"hands-on-a-hardbody-2013","cs":62.48,"rc":18,"bd":{"positive":4,"mixed":9,"negative":5},"rv":[{"cn":"Mark Kennedy","o":"Associated Press","s":82,"b":"Positive","t":1,"u":"https://online.wsj.com/article/AP2ae4a5b5ef0448d3a7db89d2dc5a931a.html","d":"2013-03-21","q":"By the end of the show, you'll swear that truck can dance."},{"cn":"Charles Isherwood","o":"The New York Times","s":79,"b":"Positive","t":1,"u":"http://www.nytimes.com/2013/03/22/theater/reviews/hands-on-a-hardbody-at-the-brooks-atkinson-theater.html?pagewanted=all&_r=1&","d":"2013-03-21","q":"This scrappy, sincere new musical brings a fresh, handmade feeling to Broadway, which mostly traffics in the machine tooled."},{"cn":"Mark Kennedy","o":"The Washington Post","s":78,"b":"Positive","t":1,"u":"https://www.washingtonpost.com/entertainment/music/review-musical-hands-on-a-hardbody-a-tuneful-heart-filled-ode-to-small-towns-and-america/2013/03/21/5aafea1e-9285-11e2-9173-7f87cda73b49_story.html","d":"2013-03-21"},{"cn":"David Rooney","o":"The Hollywood Reporter","s":74,"b":"Positive","t":1,"u":"https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/review/hands-a-hardbody-theater-review-430291","d":"2013-03-21","q":"That makes this gently appealing show a welcome change of pace, even if its folksy simplicity makes it a commercial challenge."},{"cn":"Jesse Green","o":"Vulture","s":64,"b":"Mixed","t":1,"u":"http://www.vulture.com/2013/03/theater-review-hands-on-a-hardbody.html","d":"2013-03-21","q":"For all the worthy effort to valorize lives not usually depicted in musicals, this has the opposite effect: It makes them seem petty."},{"cn":"Marilyn Stasio","o":"Variety","s":63,"b":"Mixed","t":1,"u":"https://variety.com/2013/legit/reviews/legit-review-hands-on-a-hardbody-1200327151/","d":"2013-04-14","q":"Still, no matter how this dark tuner fares under Gotham’s cold glare, regional bookers should be lining up six deep."},{"cn":"David Cote","o":"Time Out New York","s":58,"b":"Mixed","t":1,"u":"http://www.timeout.com/newyork/theater/hands-on-a-hardbody","d":"2013-03-21","q":"While not as dull as watching paint dry on a four-wheeler, Hardbody has too puny an engine to take anyone very far."},{"cn":"Linda Winer","o":"Newsday","s":54,"b":"Negative","t":1,"u":"https://www.newsday.com/news/new-york/theater-review-hands-on-a-hardbody-3-stars-q83069","d":"2013-03-21","q":"But if you go into the show wondering why a gifted creative team would want to adapt the 1997 documentary about poor Texans in an endurance contest for a red Nissan pickup, you are likely to leave wondering the same thing."},{"cn":"Elisabeth Vincentelli","o":"New York Post","s":44,"b":"Negative","t":1,"u":"https://www.nypost.com/p/entertainment/theater/cast_is_game_lyrics_lame_Xw47OLsWzv5DJRkmsdx7nI","d":"2013-03-22","q":"Rarely has so much goodwill been so squandered."},{"cn":"Terry Teachout","o":"The Wall Street Journal","s":37,"b":"Negative","t":1,"u":"https://www.wsj.com/articles/SB10001424127887324789504578433133243583054","d":"2013-04-14","q":"The resulting confusion of tone proves fatal."},{"cn":"Elysa Gardner","o":"USA Today","s":75,"b":"Positive","t":2,"u":"https://www.usatoday.com/story/life/2013/03/21/hands-on-a-hardbody-broadway/2002385/","d":"2013-03-21","q":"With all that going for it, Hardbody holds up better than you might expect."},{"cn":"Matt Windman","o":"amNewYork","s":73,"b":"Positive","t":2,"u":"https://www.amny.com/urbanite-1.812039/theater-review-hands-on-a-hardbody-3-stars-1.4861751","d":"2013-03-21","q":"Neil Pepe's production is quite gripping - most impressive is how the actors manipulate the vehicle and perform dance choreography while their hands are still attached to it."},{"cn":"Clark Collis","o":"Entertainment Weekly","s":62,"b":"Mixed","t":2,"u":"https://ew.com/article/2013/04/08/hands-on-a-hardbody-to-close-on-broadway/?srsltid=AfmBOopoX7WhC_957UWAGxaYgsjSZ0Db8Q4_wibJJEJfmcRCnksw7C9T","d":"2013-04-08","q":"Few of the numbers in Hands on a Hardbody are as memorable as that melancholic ditty."},{"cn":"Jeremy Gerard","o":"Bloomberg","s":61,"b":"Mixed","t":2,"u":"https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2013-03-21/in-hardbody-truck-stops-here-it-s-superman-review","d":"2013-03-21","q":"There's nothing unlikable about 'Hands on a Hardbody,' but little to love, either."},{"cn":"Joe Dziemianowicz","o":"New York Daily News","s":61,"b":"Mixed","t":2,"u":"https://www.nydailynews.com/2013/03/21/theater-review-hands-on-a-hardbody/","d":"2013-03-21","q":"As is, it’s a bit of a missed opportunity."},{"cn":"Erik Haagensen","o":"Backstage","s":45,"b":"Negative","t":2,"u":"https://www.backstage.com/review/ny-theater/broadway/hands-on-a-hardbody-amanda-green-doug-wright-trey-anastasio-keith-carradine-hunter-foster/","d":"2013-03-21","q":"The tuner coarsens its self-effacing, quietly observant source with cheesy soap-opera backstories, forced Lifetime-movie subplotting, and self-righteous hot-button-issue pressing in an obviously manipulative attempt to stir our emotions."},{"cn":"Matthew Murray","o":"Talkin' Broadway","s":44,"b":"Negative","t":2,"u":"http://www.talkinbroadway.com/world/HandsHardbody.html","d":"2013-04-05","q":"The show's biggest problem is that it doesn't know what it wants to be."},{"cn":"Eric March","o":"Theater Life","s":70,"b":"Positive","t":3,"u":"https://theaterlife.com/hands-on-a-hardbody-12/","d":"2013-04-15","q":"Unfortunately, the music – a mix of country, rock and bluegrass – falls short of inspiring."}],"au":{"score":52,"designation":"Loathing","sources":{"mz":{"s":52,"c":24,"sr":2.6}}},"ta":"256 W 47th St, New York, NY 10036","pd":"2013-02-23","ca":[{"n":"Keith Carradine","r":"JD Drew"},{"n":"Allison Case","r":"Kelli Mangrum"},{"n":"Hunter Foster","r":"Benny Perkins"},{"n":"Jay Armstrong Johnson","r":"Greg Wilhote"},{"n":"David Larsen","r":"Chris Alvaro"},{"n":"Jacob Ming-Trent","r":"Ronald McCowan"},{"n":"Kathleen Elizabeth Monteleone","r":"Heather Stovall"},{"n":"Mary Gordon Murray","r":"Virginia Drew"},{"n":"Jim Newman","r":"Mike Ferris"},{"n":"Connie Ray","r":"Cindy Barnes"},{"n":"Jon Rua","r":"Jesus Peña"},{"n":"Keala Settle","r":"Norma Valverde"},{"n":"Dale Soules","r":"Janis Curtis"},{"n":"Scott Wakefield","r":"Frank Nugent"},{"n":"William Youmans","r":"Don Curtis"}]}